sequenceDiagram
  participant User as Authorized user
  participant Api as FastAPI application
  participant Policy as Policy engine
  participant Registry as Tool registry
  participant Tool as MCP or integration tool
  participant Audit as Audit store
  User->>Api: Submit request
  Api->>Policy: Check user tenant agent and action policy
  Policy-->>Api: Allow restricted read-only tool or deny
  Api->>Registry: Resolve approved tool schema and limits
  Registry-->>Api: Validated tool contract
  Api->>Tool: Invoke validated arguments with scoped credential
  Tool-->>Api: Result or bounded failure
  Api->>Audit: Record request policy result and outcome
  Api-->>User: Stream safe result or error
